<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="ko">
<head>
<meta charset="UTF-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
<title>종합소득세 계산기</title>
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net">
<link href="https://cdn.jsdelivr.net/gh/orioncactus/pretendard@v1.3.9/dist/web/static/pretendard.css" rel="stylesheet">
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Noto+Serif+KR:wght@700&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
<style>
:root{
  --paper:#FBF8F2;
  --ink:#1B2A41;
  --ink-soft:#4B5768;
  --line:#D9D2C2;
  --stamp:#B23A2E;
  --stamp-soft:#F3E3E0;
  --accent:#1B6B5C;
  --accent-soft:#E1EEEA;
  --paper-card:#FFFFFF;
}
*{box-sizing:border-box;}
body{
  margin:0;
  background:var(--paper);
  color:var(--ink);
  font-family:'Pretendard','Noto Sans KR',-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,sans-serif;
  line-height:1.55;
  padding:32px 16px 64px;
}
.wrap{max-width:520px;margin:0 auto;}
.doc-head{
  border-bottom:3px double var(--ink);
  padding-bottom:16px;
  margin-bottom:24px;
}
.doc-no{
  font-size:12px;
  letter-spacing:.04em;
  color:var(--ink-soft);
  margin:0 0 6px;
}
.doc-title{
  font-family:'Noto Serif KR',serif;
  font-size:26px;
  font-weight:700;
  margin:0 0 8px;
}
.doc-sub{
  font-size:14px;
  color:var(--ink-soft);
  margin:0;
}
.card{
  background:var(--paper-card);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:4px;
  padding:20px;
  margin-bottom:18px;
}
.field{margin-bottom:16px;}
.field:last-child{margin-bottom:0;}
label{
  display:block;
  font-size:13px;
  font-weight:600;
  color:var(--ink);
  margin-bottom:6px;
}
.hint{
  font-size:12px;
  color:var(--ink-soft);
  margin-top:4px;
}
input[type=number], input[type=text], select{
  width:100%;
  padding:10px 12px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:3px;
  font-size:15px;
  font-family:inherit;
  background:#fff;
  color:var(--ink);
}
input:focus, select:focus{
  outline:2px solid var(--accent);
  outline-offset:1px;
}
.radio-row{display:flex;gap:10px;flex-wrap:wrap;}
.radio-row label{
  display:flex;align-items:center;gap:6px;
  font-weight:500;font-size:14px;
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  padding:8px 12px;border-radius:20px;
  cursor:pointer;margin-bottom:0;
}
.radio-row input{width:auto;}
.check-row{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;}
.check-row label{margin:0;font-weight:500;}
.check-row input{width:auto;}
button.calc{
  width:100%;
  background:var(--stamp);
  color:#fff;
  border:none;
  padding:14px;
  font-size:16px;
  font-weight:700;
  border-radius:3px;
  cursor:pointer;
  letter-spacing:.02em;
}
button.calc:hover{filter:brightness(0.92);}
.result{
  display:none;
  background:var(--paper-card);
  border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:4px;
  padding:20px;
}
.result.show{display:block;}
.result h2{
  font-family:'Noto Serif KR',serif;
  font-size:16px;
  margin:0 0 14px;
  padding-bottom:10px;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.row{
  display:flex;
  justify-content:space-between;
  font-size:14px;
  padding:6px 0;
  color:var(--ink-soft);
}
.row.total{
  border-top:2px solid var(--ink);
  margin-top:8px;
  padding-top:12px;
  font-size:18px;
  font-weight:700;
  color:var(--stamp);
}
.row.total .num{font-family:'Pretendard',monospace;}
.badge{
  display:inline-block;
  background:var(--accent-soft);
  color:var(--accent);
  font-size:12px;
  font-weight:700;
  padding:3px 9px;
  border-radius:20px;
  margin-bottom:10px;
}
.note{
  font-size:12px;
  color:var(--ink-soft);
  background:var(--stamp-soft);
  border-left:3px solid var(--stamp);
  padding:10px 12px;
  margin-top:20px;
  border-radius:2px;
}
footer{
  text-align:center;
  font-size:11px;
  color:var(--ink-soft);
  margin-top:28px;
}
</style>
</head>
<body>
<div class="wrap">
  <div class="doc-head">
    <p class="doc-no">TAX CALC · 01 — 종합소득세</p>
    <h1 class="doc-title">종합소득세 계산기</h1>
    <p class="doc-sub">과세표준만 입력하면 8단계 누진세율로 예상 세액을 계산합니다.</p>
  </div>
  
<div class="card">
  <div class="field">
    <label for="base">연간 과세표준 (만 원)</label>
    <input type="number" id="base" placeholder="예: 4000" min="0">
    <p class="hint">과세표준 = 종합소득금액 − 소득공제(인적공제·연금보험료공제 등). 총급여가 아닌, 각종 공제를 이미 뺀 금액을 입력하세요.</p>
  </div>
</div>
<button class="calc" onclick="calc()">세액 계산하기</button>
<div class="result" id="result">
  <span class="badge">2023~2025년 귀속 기준 (8단계 누진세율)</span>
  <h2>예상 종합소득세 산출 내역</h2>
  <div class="row"><span>적용 구간</span><span class="num" id="bracket"></span></div>
  <div class="row"><span>산출세액 (과세표준 × 세율 − 누진공제)</span><span class="num" id="calcTax"></span></div>
  <div class="row"><span>지방소득세 (산출세액의 10%)</span><span class="num" id="localTax"></span></div>
  <div class="row total"><span>총 납부세액(예상)</span><span class="num" id="totalTax"></span></div>
</div>

  <div class="note">프리랜서·개인사업자·임대소득자 등 종합소득세 신고 대상자를 위한 산출세액 추정 도구입니다. 세액공제(자녀세액공제, 기부금세액공제 등)는 반영되지 않았으니 실제 납부세액은 이보다 낮아질 수 있습니다.</div>
  <footer>본 계산기는 참고용 추정치이며 법적 효력이 없습니다. 정확한 세액은 홈택스·위택스 모의계산 또는 세무사 상담을 통해 확인하세요.</footer>
</div>
<script>
const BRACKETS = [
  {limit: 1400, rate: 0.06, deduction: 0, label: '1,400만원 이하 · 6%'},
  {limit: 5000, rate: 0.15, deduction: 126, label: '1,400만~5,000만원 · 15%'},
  {limit: 8800, rate: 0.24, deduction: 576, label: '5,000만~8,800만원 · 24%'},
  {limit: 15000, rate: 0.35, deduction: 1544, label: '8,800만~1억5,000만원 · 35%'},
  {limit: 30000, rate: 0.38, deduction: 1994, label: '1억5,000만~3억원 · 38%'},
  {limit: 50000, rate: 0.40, deduction: 2594, label: '3억~5억원 · 40%'},
  {limit: 100000, rate: 0.42, deduction: 3594, label: '5억~10억원 · 42%'},
  {limit: Infinity, rate: 0.45, deduction: 6594, label: '10억원 초과 · 45%'}
];
function fmt(n){ return Math.round(n).toLocaleString('ko-KR') + '만원'; }
function calc(){
  const base = parseFloat(document.getElementById('base').value);
  if(!base || base <= 0){ alert('과세표준을 입력해주세요.'); return; }
  const b = BRACKETS.find(x => base <= x.limit);
  const calcTax = Math.max(0, base * b.rate - b.deduction);
  const localTax = calcTax * 0.1;
  document.getElementById('bracket').textContent = b.label;
  document.getElementById('calcTax').textContent = fmt(calcTax);
  document.getElementById('localTax').textContent = fmt(localTax);
  document.getElementById('totalTax').textContent = fmt(calcTax + localTax);
  document.getElementById('result').classList.add('show');
}
</script>
</body>
</html>
